      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Role of Technology in Legal Translation",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Legal translation has evolved significantly with the advent of technology. While traditional translation methods rely heavily on human expertise and knowledge of legal systems, modern legal translators can now utilize electronic tools to improve their work. One of the most useful tools is the electronic corpus, a large database of texts that allows translators to check the frequency and context of legal terms. Tools like COCA (Corpus of Contemporary American English) and BNC (British National Corpus) help translators find accurate equivalents in their target language."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In addition to corpora, machine translation is becoming increasingly popular in legal translation. While it can provide a quick draft of a document, human translators still play a crucial role in refining the text and ensuring that it meets legal standards. Concordance software also assists by showing how words are used in context, ensuring that the translation fits the legal context."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "textAlign": "justify"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Technology has made legal translation more efficient and accurate, but it is essential for translators to have a deep understanding of both legal terminology and the limitations of these tools."
          }
        ]
      },
